BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ep-keydebate-20260311T090000@brussels-news-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260311T120000Z
SUMMARY:EP Plenary (Strasbourg) - Key debate: EUCO prep & Middle East
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Brussels:20260311T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Brussels:20260311T115000
LOCATION:Strasbourg (European Parliament)
DESCRIPTION:Joint debate - EUCO and situation in the Middle East: Preparation of the European Council meeting of 19-20 March 2026; and debate on the US-Israel military operation against the Iranian regime, its consequences and the need to support the people of Iran.\nSource: https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/agenda/weekly-agenda
URL:https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/agenda/weekly-agenda
END:VEVENT

